hook-redactor tests/red_team.rs §9: prompt_allows_already_redacted_paste (as pattern input).
Rust labels are not placeholders of the ADR-0006 grammar, so they match again;
after normalisation both sides agree.
-- input --
APP_CLIENT_SECRET=<redacted:client_secret>
Authorization: <redacted:auth_header>
-- must_not_contain --
<redacted:client_secret>
<redacted:auth_header>
-- want --
APP_CLIENT_SECRET=<redacted:api_key>
Authorization: <redacted:api_key>
